  <div class="pillars">
    <div class="pillar">
      <span class="pillar-icon">&#10022;</span>
      <h3>Faith Support</h3>
      <p>Displacement is not only an economic crisis. It is a spiritual one. Prayer, scripture, and a community that understands the theological weight of being removed from your vocation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <span class="pillar-icon">&#9670;</span>
      <h3>Study Support</h3>
      <p>Accountability partners, weekly cohort check-ins, and navigation support through every platform. You do not figure out the coursework alone. That is what the cohort is for.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <span class="pillar-icon">&#9671;</span>
      <h3>Emotional Support</h3>
      <p>Long-term displacement leaves marks. We do not rush past them. We sit with you in it and move forward together when you are ready.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <span class="pillar-icon">&#9633;</span>
      <h3>Job Placement</h3>
      <p>Resume building, LinkedIn profile creation, mock interviews, and direct connections to the Institute&#8217;s employer network. Graduation is not the finish line. Employment is.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- PATHWAYS -->
<div class="section section-schoolhouse fade-up" id="pathways">
  <div class="section-label">Free Learning Pathways</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">Certifications That <em>Open Doors</em></h2>
  <p class="body-text">
    Every pathway below costs participants nothing. Every credential is industry-recognized and employer-verifiable. We help you choose the right path, stay on track, and complete it.
  </p>

  <div class="pathway" style="margin-top:3rem;">
    <div class="pathway-header">
      <div>
        <div class="pathway-provider">Google &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; IBM</div>
        <h3>IT Support &amp; Helpdesk</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-meta-row">
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Duration</strong><span>8&#8211;12 weeks</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Starting Salary</strong><span>$35,000&#8211;$55,000</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Cost</strong><span>Free</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-body">
      <p class="pathway-desc">The fastest entry point into technology employment. Help desk and IT support roles exist at every organization of every size. No prior experience required.</p>
      <div class="certs-list">
        <span class="cert-tag">Google IT Support Certificate</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">IBM IT Support Badge</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">CompTIA A+ Preparation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="jobs-row">
        <div class="jobs-label">Jobs This Opens</div>
        <div class="jobs-list">
          <span>Help Desk Technician</span>
          <span>IT Support Specialist</span>
          <span>Desktop Support Analyst</span>
          <span>Systems Technician</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://grow.google/certificates" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pathway-link">Google Career Certificates &#8599;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pathway">
    <div class="pathway-header">
      <div>
        <div class="pathway-provider">Google &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; IBM</div>
        <h3>Cybersecurity Fundamentals</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-meta-row">
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Duration</strong><span>10&#8211;14 weeks</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Starting Salary</strong><span>$50,000&#8211;$70,000</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Cost</strong><span>Free</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-body">
      <p class="pathway-desc">One of the highest-demand fields in technology with a severe talent shortage. No prior IT experience required for the Google certificate pathway.</p>
      <div class="certs-list">
        <span class="cert-tag">Google Cybersecurity Certificate</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">IBM Cybersecurity Fundamentals Badge</span>
      </div>
      <div class="jobs-row">
        <div class="jobs-label">Jobs This Opens</div>
        <div class="jobs-list">
          <span>Security Operations Analyst</span>
          <span>Cybersecurity Technician</span>
          <span>Incident Response Analyst</span>
          <span>Security Compliance Associate</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://grow.google/certificates" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pathway-link">Google Career Certificates &#8599;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pathway">
    <div class="pathway-header">
      <div>
        <div class="pathway-provider">Microsoft Learn</div>
        <h3>Cloud Computing Basics</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-meta-row">
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Duration</strong><span>8&#8211;10 weeks</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Cost</strong><span>Free*</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-body">
      <p class="pathway-desc">Cloud skills are required across virtually every technology role. Azure Fundamentals is the most accessible entry point and opens doors across Microsoft&#8217;s entire ecosystem. *AZ-900 exam voucher (~$165) &#8212; the Institute pursues Microsoft for Nonprofits voucher coverage for all participants.</p>
      <div class="certs-list">
        <span class="cert-tag">Microsoft Azure Fundamentals AZ-900</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">IBM Cloud Essentials Badge</span>
      </div>
      <div class="jobs-row">
        <div class="jobs-label">Jobs This Opens</div>
        <div class="jobs-list">
          <span>Azure Cloud Associate</span>
          <span>Cloud Operations Technician</span>
          <span>Systems Administrator</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pathway-link">Microsoft Learn &#8599;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pathway">
    <div class="pathway-header">
      <div>
        <div class="pathway-provider">Google &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; IBM</div>
        <h3>Data Analytics</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-meta-row">
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Duration</strong><span>12&#8211;16 weeks</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Starting Salary</strong><span>$45,000&#8211;$65,000</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Cost</strong><span>Free</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-body">
      <p class="pathway-desc">Data skills are the most broadly applicable technical competency in the modern economy. Entry-level roles exist across every industry sector.</p>
      <div class="certs-list">
        <span class="cert-tag">Google Data Analytics Professional Certificate</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">IBM Data Analyst Badge</span>
      </div>
      <div class="jobs-row">
        <div class="jobs-label">Jobs This Opens</div>
        <div class="jobs-list">
          <span>Junior Data Analyst</span>
          <span>Business Intelligence Analyst</span>
          <span>Data Operations Technician</span>
          <span>Reporting Analyst</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://grow.google/certificates" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pathway-link">Google Career Certificates &#8599;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pathway">
    <div class="pathway-header">
      <div>
        <div class="pathway-provider">IBM &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Anthropic</div>
        <h3>AI Tools &amp; Workflow Automation</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-meta-row">
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Duration</strong><span>4&#8211;6 weeks</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Cost</strong><span>Free</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-body">
      <p class="pathway-desc">The most immediately practical pathway for workers displaced by AI specifically. Teaches participants to work with AI tools rather than be replaced by them. Applicable across every industry and role type.</p>
      <div class="certs-list">
        <span class="cert-tag">IBM AI Fundamentals Badge</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">Anthropic AI Fluency Certificate</span>
      </div>
      <div class="jobs-row">
        <div class="jobs-label">Jobs This Opens</div>
        <div class="jobs-list">
          <span>AI Operations Associate</span>
          <span>Prompt Engineering Specialist</span>
          <span>Workflow Automation Coordinator</span>
          <span>Digital Operations Technician</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://skillsbuild.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pathway-link">IBM SkillsBuild &#8599;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pathway">
    <div class="pathway-header">
      <div>
        <div class="pathway-provider">GCFGlobal &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Microsoft Learn</div>
        <h3>Microsoft Office &amp; Administrative Technology</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-meta-row">
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Duration</strong><span>4&#8211;8 weeks</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Cost</strong><span>Free</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-body">
      <p class="pathway-desc">The foundational pathway for participants moving into administrative, clerical, and office support roles. Broad applicability across every employment sector.</p>
      <div class="certs-list">
        <span class="cert-tag">Microsoft Office Specialist Certification</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">GCFGlobal Completion Certificate</span>
      </div>
      <div class="jobs-row">
        <div class="jobs-label">Jobs This Opens</div>
        <div class="jobs-list">
          <span>Administrative Assistant</span>
          <span>Office Coordinator</span>
          <span>Receptionist</span>
          <span>Data Entry Specialist</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://gcfglobal.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pathway-link">GCFGlobal &#8599;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pathway">
    <div class="pathway-header">
      <div>
        <div class="pathway-provider">GCFGlobal &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Khan Academy</div>
        <h3>Digital Literacy Foundations</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="pathway-meta-row">
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Duration</strong><span>2&#8211;4 weeks</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-meta"><strong>Cost</strong><span>Free</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pathway-body">
      <p class="pathway-desc">No participant is turned away for lack of baseline skills. This pathway is for anyone who needs foundational computer, internet, and device proficiency before entering a technical track. It is the prerequisite for every other pathway &#8212; and it is where we meet you if that is where you are.</p>
      <div class="certs-list">
        <span class="cert-tag">GCFGlobal Completion Certificate</span>
        <span class="cert-tag">Khan Academy Skill Badges</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://gcfglobal.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="pathway-link">GCFGlobal &#8599;</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<div class="section fade-up" id="model">
  <div class="section-label">The Cohort Model</div>
  <h2 class="section-title">You Will Not Do This <em>Alone</em></h2>
  <p class="body-text">Human beings were not created to learn alone. All pathways are delivered in cohorts of 8&#8211;15 participants. Community accountability is one of the most powerful drivers of completion in adult workforce training. This is a theological conviction, not a logistical preference.</p>
  <div class="cohort-steps">
    <div class="cohort-step">
      <div class="step-num">Week 0</div>
      <h4>Intake &amp; Assessment</h4>
      <p>Pathway selection, digital literacy baseline, and device access coordination for participants without equipment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cohort-step">
      <div class="step-num">Week 1</div>
      <h4>Cohort Orientation</h4>
      <p>All participants complete IBM Workplace Readiness together, building cohort identity and earning a digital credential immediately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cohort-step">
      <div class="step-num">Weeks 2&#8211;12</div>
      <h4>Primary Pathway</h4>
      <p>Individual pathway training with weekly cohort check-ins, peer support, and Institute navigation assistance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cohort-step">
      <div class="step-num">Final 2 Weeks</div>
      <h4>Portfolio &amp; Placement</h4>
      <p>Resume building, LinkedIn profile, mock interviews, and direct employer network introductions. Graduation and credential presentation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cohort-step">
      <div class="step-num">Post-Graduation</div>
      <h4>Alumni Network</h4>
      <p>Graduates mentor incoming cohorts, fulfilling the theological obligation of the equipped to equip others.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- APPLY -->
<div class="contact-section" id="apply">
  <div class="contact-inner">
    <div class="section-label">Join Us</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Apply <em>Free</em></h2>
    <p class="contact-intro">
      Tell us where you are. We will meet you there. There is no cost, no obligation, and no judgment &#8212; just community and a path forward.
    </p>
    <div class="form-row">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="fname">First Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="fname" placeholder="First">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="lname">Last Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="lname" placeholder="Last">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="email">Email Address</label>
      <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="situation">Your Situation</label>
      <select id="situation">
        <option value="">Select one...</option>
        <option>Recently displaced from work</option>
        <option>Long-term unemployed</option>
        <option>Looking to change careers</option>
        <option>Underemployed, seeking advancement</option>
        <option>Other</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="pathway">Pathway of Interest</label>
      <select id="pathway">
        <option value="">Select one...</option>
        <option>IT Support and Helpdesk</option>
        <option>Cybersecurity Fundamentals</option>
        <option>Cloud Computing Basics</option>
        <option>Data Analytics</option>
        <option>AI Tools and Workflow Automation</option>
        <option>Microsoft Office and Administrative Technology</option>
        <option>Digital Literacy Foundations</option>
        <option>Not sure yet &#8212; I need guidance</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="support">What Do You Need Most?</label>
      <select id="support">
        <option value="">Select one...</option>
        <option>Help choosing and completing a certification</option>
        <option>Study support and accountability</option>
        <option>Resume and interview help</option>
        <option>Emotional and faith support</option>
        <option>All of the above</option>
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="message">Anything Else You Want Us to Know</label>
      <textarea id="message" placeholder="Optional &#8212; share as much or as little as you like."></textarea>
    </div>
    <button class="form-submit" onclick="submitApplication()">Submit Application</button>
    <p class="form-notice">
      Clicking submit opens Gmail pre-addressed to our applications inbox.<br>
      You will need a Gmail account &#8212; you will need one anyway for Google Career Certificates.<br>
      Your application goes directly to applications@thessalonian-mandate-institute.org
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-name">The <em>Thessalonian</em> Mandate Institute</div>
  <div class="footer-mono">Austin, Texas &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Est. 2026 &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; EIN 42-2419586 &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; 26 U.S.C. &#167; 508(c)(1)(A)</div>
  <p>
    Founded by Minister Rickey Jay Bennett II.<br>
    Rooted in 2 Thessalonians 3:10 and 1 Thessalonians 4:11.<br><br>
    <a href="mailto:applications@thessalonian-mandate-institute.org">applications@thessalonian-mandate-institute.org</a>
    &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp;
    <a href="mailto:shepherd_jade@thessalonian-mandate-institute.org">shepherd_jade@thessalonian-mandate-institute.org</a>
  </p>
</footer>

<script>
  function submitApplication() {
    var fname    = document.getElementById('fname').value.trim();
    var lname    = document.getElementById('lname').value.trim();
    var email    = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
    var situation = document.getElementById('situation').value;
    var pathway  = document.getElementById('pathway').value;
    var support  = document.getElementById('support').value;
    var message  = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();

    if (!fname || !lname || !email) {
      alert('Please fill in your name and email address before submitting.');
      return;
    }

    var body =
      'TMI APPLICATION\n' +
      '===============\n\n' +
      'Name: ' + fname + ' ' + lname + '\n' +
      'Email: ' + email + '\n' +
      'Situation: ' + (situation || 'Not specified') + '\n' +
      'Pathway of Interest: ' + (pathway || 'Not specified') + '\n' +
      'Support Needed: ' + (support || 'Not specified') + '\n\n' +
      'Additional Information:\n' + (message || 'None provided');

    var subject = 'TMI Application - ' + fname + ' ' + lname;
    var to = 'applications@thessalonian-mandate-institute.org';

    var gmailUrl =
      'https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1' +
      '&to=' + encodeURIComponent(to) +
      '&su=' + encodeURIComponent(subject) +
      '&body=' + encodeURIComponent(body);

    window.open(gmailUrl, '_blank');
  }

  var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries) {
    entries.forEach(function(e) { if (e.isIntersecting) e.target.classList.add('visible'); });
  }, { threshold: 0.08 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach(function(el) { observer.observe(el); });
</script>

</body>
</html>
